                    "authorAssociation": "NONE",
                    "body": "apologize.. last update. I finally found the solution. In the `zk` documentation about lsp configuration, there is one option said `Indicates whether additionalTextEdits will be used to remove the trigger characters`,[zk lsp configuration](https://zk-org.github.io/zk/config/config-lsp.html). After I setup this option in zk configuration, it finally worked.\r\nNot sure this change happened before or after [#826], but let me also post the solution there..\r\nFinally I have `mini.completion` in place and working well. A great day!",
                    "bodyHTML": "<p dir=\"auto\">apologize.. last update. I finally found the solution. In the <code class=\"notranslate\">zk</code> documentation about lsp configuration, there is one option said <code class=\"notranslate\">Indicates whether additionalTextEdits will be used to remove the trigger characters</code>,<a href=\"https://zk-org.github.io/zk/config/config-lsp.html\" rel=\"nofollow\">zk lsp configuration</a>. After I setup this option in zk configuration, it finally worked.<br>\nNot sure this change happened before or after [<a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"2254568216\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/nvim-mini/mini.nvim/issues/826\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/nvim-mini/mini.nvim/issues/826/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/nvim-mini/mini.nvim/issues/826\">#826</a>], but let me also post the solution there..<br>\nFinally I have <code class=\"notranslate\">mini.completion</code> in place and working well. A great day!</p>",
